## 1. Input a year and find whether it is a leap year or not
### Pseudocode
START  
Input year  
IF year % 400 == 0  
    Print "Leap Year"  
ELSE IF year % 100 == 0  
    Print "Not a Leap Year"  
ELSE IF year % 4 == 0  
    Print "Leap Year"  
ELSE  
    Print "Not a Leap Year" 


